            "text": "Office Moving is a complete office relocation — desks and workstations, files and records runs, and office equipment — planned and quoted flat. Full or partial packing for offices is part of the service, staging at our warehouse covers the gap when the dates do not line up neatly, and placement at the new site runs in the order your team needs it: planned as a sequence with you, staged when the dates require it, and placed at the new address in the order your team needs to work. Flat Rate Movers Martinsburg WV, 736 Williamsport Pike Suite 2, Martinsburg, WV 25404. Hours: Mon-Fri 9-6, Sat 9-4, Sun 9-4. Phone +1-540-422-2153. Martinsburg service areas (Google Business Profile, 14): Inwood, Hagerstown MD, Hedgesville, Paw Paw 25434, Shepherdstown, Berkeley County, Moorefield 26836, Bunker Hill 25413, Charles Town 25414, Clear Spring MD 21722, Summit Point 25446, Harpers Ferry 25425, Kearneysville 25430, Eastern Panhandle of West Virginia."
